    "\"The armies face each other\" came through Reuben Lineman at 295560 (arrive), before contact; Watch put the camera 0.61 miles from the field",
    "\"The attack at San Jacinto\" came at the parade (parade), before contact: \"At Reuben Lineman's side: the captain passes the word down the company - \"Parade under arms. We're going at them this afternoon.\" Reuben Lineman is in the line.\"",
    "Emily West and Santa Anna are visible at the picnic as a labelled later story, with animated conversation before the guns",
    "the formed Texian line against the camp at rest: nearest-neighbour spread 0.037 against 0.369; the breastwork and the marsh drawn (82 pieces)",
    "fire and smoke on the screen at every one of 13 sampled moments (shots 34 -> 124; smoke in view 12-157; the guns fired 14 times)",
    "the line came apart into a rout on both sides; 37 figures down and lying still, 13 with hands raised - no blood, no gore",
    "words over the speakers: sj-stop-firing, sj-there, sj-many, command:1, command:2, sj-grape, sj-colonel, sj-out, sj-taunt, sj-cobardes, sj-back, sj-more, sj-bridge, sj-wait, sj-emily-waiting-0, sj-emily-waiting-1, sj-fall-in, sj-emily-parade-0, sj-finally, sj-about-time, sj-hold, sj-emily-advance-0, sj-dress, sj-tejanos, sj-formar, sj-emily-guns-0, sj-armas, sj-alamo-0, sj-alamo-1, sj-fuego, sj-alamo-2, sj-goliad-0, sj-goliad-1, sj-goliad-2, sj-over, sj-rindo, sj-me-no-alamo, sj-alamo-again-0, sj-alamo-again-1, sj-alamo-again-2, sj-stop, sj-piedad, sj-cease",
