    "the Host sees it live (killing), its camera on the field; spotlights seen: sj-arrive:295560, sj-skirmish:295800, sj-bridge:296880, sj-parade:297210, san-jacinto:297270",
    "the family with nobody there was sent nothing of the fight - no battle, no alert, no name - before and after a reload",
